From 826263a3614132b945ff238b632ad6ea456ea5a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: royka1 <397414+royka1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:33:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: sc8280xp: Give a stereo amplifier pair both
 receive slots

The machine driver gave each codec on a multi-codec link only its first
receive slot (codec N: RX1 = slot N), leaving RX2 at the CS35L41 reset
default, slot 1. For the Xiaomi 12T Pro's speaker pair that makes the
right (bottom) amplifier receive its own channel on both inputs.

Its speaker protection firmware (Cirrus CSPL, the vendor tuning) takes
RX2 as the opposite channel, as the vendor driver programs it
(cirrus,right-channel-amp: RX1 = 1, RX2 = 0; left: RX1 = 0, RX2 = 1).
With both inputs on the same channel it keeps the output silent: the
bottom speaker played nothing while the left one was unaffected, and
without the firmware (plain ASP path) both played.

For a pair, program RX1 = own slot and RX2 = the other one.

Device-tested on the Xiaomi 12T Pro (register write first, then this
patch).

Signed-off-by: royka1 <397414+royka1@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c | 15 ++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
index 4c25af22f..8cb49a05d 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c
@@ -69,15 +69,24 @@ static int sc8280xp_snd_init(struct snd_soc_pcm_runtime *rtd)
 		 * The DSP provides bit clock and frame sync; codecs follow.
 		 * With several codecs on one link (e.g. a pair of speaker
 		 * amplifiers), codec N takes slot N: left, right, ...
+		 *
+		 * A stereo pair also gets the other channel as its second
+		 * receive slot, as the vendor CS35L41 driver programs it
+		 * (cirrus,right-channel-amp: RX1 = 1, RX2 = 0). The speaker
+		 * protection firmware takes RX2 as the opposite channel; left
+		 * at its reset default (slot 1) the right amplifier receives
+		 * its own channel twice and the firmware keeps it silent.
 		 */
 		for_each_rtd_codec_dais(rtd, i, codec_dai) {
-			unsigned int slot = i;
+			unsigned int slots[2] = { i, !i };
 
 			snd_soc_dai_set_fmt(codec_dai, SND_SOC_DAIFMT_CBC_CFC |
 					    SND_SOC_DAIFMT_I2S |
 					    SND_SOC_DAIFMT_NB_NF);
-			if (rtd->dai_link->num_codecs > 1)
-				snd_soc_dai_set_channel_map(codec_dai, 0, NULL, 1, &slot);
+			if (rtd->dai_link->num_codecs == 2)
+				snd_soc_dai_set_channel_map(codec_dai, 0, NULL, 2, slots);
+			else if (rtd->dai_link->num_codecs > 2)
+				snd_soc_dai_set_channel_map(codec_dai, 0, NULL, 1, slots);
 		}
 		break;
 	case WSA_CODEC_DMA_RX_0:
